Package: opencode-glibc-standalone
Version: ${OPENCODE_VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCHITECTURE}
Maintainer: Hope2333(幽零小喵) <u0catmiao@proton.me>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: glibc, openssl-glibc, bash, ncurses
Description: OpenCode glibc standalone (frozen single-version rollback package)
 Single frozen version for rollback only. Coexists with both the native
 `opencode` package and the `opencode-glibc` package: different command
 entry `opencode-glibc` and independent lib prefix usr/lib/opencode-glibc/.
 No Conflicts/Replaces/Breaks against the literal name `opencode`, so it
 will not displace the native or glibc mainline providers.
